OL,3,GNEWSACrew unaware of risks before
OL,4,ABayesian yacht accident, say
OL,5,Ainvestigators
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe crew of the Bayesian superyacht did
OL,8,Fnot know about a critical safety risk
OL,9,Fthat left it vulnerable in powerful
OL,10,Fwinds before it sank off the coast in
OL,11,Fnorthern Sicily coast, killing seven
OL,12,Fpeople, British investigators say.
OL,14,FBritish tech tycoon Mike Lynch, 59, and
OL,15,Fhis daughter Hannah, 18, were among
OL,16,Fseven people who died when the vessel
OL,17,Fsank on 19 August 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
